  "example": false}, {"content": "I'm a geospatial agent that can help you
  analyze location-based data and create visualizations. Here's what I can
  do:\n\n## My Capabilities:\n\n**1. Find Areas of Interest (AOI)**\n- Search
    for any place worldwide (cities, countries, regions, landmarks, protected
      areas, etc.)\n- Handle different administrative levels (countries,
      states, districts, municipalities, etc.)\n\n**2. Access Datasets**\n-
      Find relevant geospatial datasets based on your questions\n- Cover topics
      like climate, environment, demographics, infrastructure, and more\n\n**3.
      Pull Data**\n- Retrieve data for specific locations and time periods\n-
      Handle various data sources and formats\n\n**4. Generate Insights &
      Visualizations**\n- Analyze the data to answer your questions\n- Create
      compelling charts and visualizations using the data\n\n## Example
      Questions I Can Help With:\n\n- \"Show me temperature trends in New York
      City over the past year\"\n- \"What's the air quality like in Delhi
      during winter months?\"\n- \"Compare rainfall patterns between different
      regions of Brazil\"\n- \"Analyze population density changes in California
      counties\"\n- \"Show deforestation trends in the Amazon
      rainforest\"\n\n## What I Need From You:\n\nTo perform any analysis, I
      need three things:\n1. **Location** - Where you want to analyze (city,
      country, region, etc.)\n2. **Dataset/Topic** - What you want to analyze
      (weather, air quality, population, etc.)\n3. **Time Period** - When you
      want to analyze (specific dates, past months, years, etc.)\n\n**Try
      asking me something like:** \"Show me air quality data for Los Angeles in
      the past 6 months\" or \"What are the temperature trends in London over
      the last year?\"\n\nWhat would you like to explore?",
